  s0: Start
  s1: Problem record is open
  s2: Stopped: no problem record
  s3: Each profile is open
  s4: Stopped: no customer profile
  s5: Ready to write, no product card
  s6: Ready to write, product job in view
  s7: Draft: job copies who or the product
  s8: Draft: profile has no job
  s9: Draft: progress in a circumstance
  s10: Check failed
  s11: Check passed, waiting for you
  s12: You accepted the jobs
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s2: you stop [no problem record yet]
  s0 --> s1: you read the problem record [when the venture has one]
  s1 --> s4: you stop [no customer profile yet]
  s1 --> s3: you read the customer profiles [when the venture has them]
  s3 --> s5: you find no product card
  s3 --> s6: you read the product's claimed job
  s5 --> s7: you write a copy of who they are, or of the product's job
  s5 --> s8: you leave the job blank
  s5 --> s9: you write the progress they are trying to make
  s6 --> s7: you write a copy of who they are, or of the product's job
  s6 --> s8: you leave the job blank
  s6 --> s9: you write the progress they are trying to make
  s7 --> s10: you run the checks
  s8 --> s10: you run the checks
  s9 --> s11: you run the checks
  s11 --> s12: you accept the draft
